.TH "CPS-APPLY" 1 "" "CPS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
\&cps\-apply \- \&Apply or resume a saved plan
.SH SYNOPSIS
.HP 4
.B \&cps apply [OPTIONS] \-\-root <IMAGE> <PLAN>
.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
.B \&<PLAN>
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \&\-\-root <IMAGE>
\&Image the plan targets
.TP
.B \&\-n, \-\-dry\-run
\&Validate the plan against cached payloads without applying it
.TP
.B \&\-h, \-\-help
\&Print help
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B \&0
\&Success. A check found nothing to report.
.TP
.B \&1
\&An error.
.TP
.B \&2
\&Invalid usage, such as an unknown option or a missing argument.
.TP
.B \&3
\&A check found something: updates are available (upgrade \-\-check), verification found problems (verify, publisher audit\-builds), pins are stale (recipe repin \-\-check), configuration or images differ (config diff, image diff), manifest dependencies are missing (manifest dependencies), or nothing matched (search, owner).
.TP
.B \&4
\&A confirmation prompt was declined.
